        "x": 170,
        "y": 1308
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Four State* lists hold every flower's place, birth time, note and loudness. A note-on appends one to each (a Switch takes the longer list only then), and once there are more than 28 the oldest are skipped. A clicked flower grows where you click; others take the next place on a golden-angle spiral (137.5°, radius growing with √n), round the garden every 60.",
